        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/91fe9fb340eddfaca07c91c80a78a295.avif?t=1788214928\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras_big/91fe9fb340eddfaca07c91c80a78a295.avif?t=1788214928 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quaso Studio: The Liven Collection</strong> brings together two first-person psychological horror experiences, crafted in a retro PS1 style and driven by an oppressive, stylized atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into two different yet connected stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/c36a848b2a541bdf82dc0d589aba6664.avif?t=1788214928\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras_big/c36a848b2a541bdf82dc0d589aba6664.avif?t=1788214928 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/5f3e1f203d64d9a533e96aae64d71fc1.avif?t=1788214928\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras_big/5f3e1f203d64d9a533e96aae64d71fc1.webp?t=1788214928 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/2384acd8b24e5b00050fc5b450987231.poster.avif?t=1788214928\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/2384acd8b24e5b00050fc5b450987231.mp4?t=1788214928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten years after <i>The To-Do List</i>, <strong>Marla Myers</strong>, director of an art gallery, finds herself trapped in a crimson velvet purgatory, haunted by her past mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She must explore the limbo of her own mind across two parallel worlds. Find the clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rouge Carmin</i> is a narrative psychological horror game with a bold painterly aesthetic.  <br>No weapons. No escape. Only your memories, your guilt… and a way out to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/389585d659fd162d88fe11b4557fa0ed.poster.avif?t=1788214928\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/389585d659fd162d88fe11b4557fa0ed.mp4?t=1788214928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow an intense, twist-filled narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and collect key clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against the monster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting, painterly atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/a10f61b7351ed701dbfc3071e0a680b0.poster.avif?t=1788214928\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/a10f61b7351ed701dbfc3071e0a680b0.mp4?t=1788214928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/2f6e18f2dfa0b245073201037f233cbc.avif?t=1788214928\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras_big/2f6e18f2dfa0b245073201037f233cbc.avif?t=1788214928 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/3871286c704ecb94d9da0caf0abeb4a8.avif?t=1788214928\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras_big/3871286c704ecb94d9da0caf0abeb4a8.webp?t=1788214928 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Kevin LIVEN</strong>, a 17-year-old home alone. As you go about your daily chores, the lights suddenly go out… <br>Someone breaks into the house. You're trapped. Hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast. Hide. Restore the power. <br>Your last hope lies in your father’s locked toolbox — but the code remains a mystery...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/58d8acc9c86845f553d33d817aa1f77c.poster.avif?t=1788214928\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/58d8acc9c86845f553d33d817aa1f77c.mp4?t=1788214928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><